## Order pages

The `order` value in frontmatter controls a page's position inside its section:

```md
---
title: "Deploy"
description: "Publish the application"
order: 3
---
```

Pages with the same order fall back to alphabetical titles.

## Link to another page

Use ordinary root-relative Markdown links:

```md
Continue with [Workflow](/docs/guides/workflow).
```

The browser gets normal URLs. Partial navigation progressively enhances the same links when JavaScript is available.
